  "setting": "雲海上的山脊",
  "subtitle": "",
  "subtitle_en": "",
  "lead": "他走之前，在屋子中央種下一支穗。她留下來，看著它變白，變暗。",
  "lead_en": "Before he left, he planted one ear of maize in the middle of the house. She stayed, and watched it pale, then darken.",
  "statement_title": "",
  "statement": "他走之前，在屋子中央種下一支穗。她留下來，看著它變白，變暗。\n\n她把玉米磨了九回，磨到像煙。\n有一天她看見很遠的地方，然後窗上起了霧。\n\n綠芽冒出來的時候，她只看得清自己的手。\n那就夠了。",
  "statement_en": "Before he left, he planted one ear of maize in the middle of the house. She stayed, and watched it pale, then darken.\n\nShe ground the maize nine times, until it was fine as smoke.\nOne day she saw very far. Then the window clouded with breath.\n\nWhen the green shoot came, she could see only her own hands.\nIt was enough.",
  "afterword": "她把玉米磨了九回，磨到像煙。\n有一天她看見很遠的地方，然後窗上起了霧。\n\n綠芽冒出來的時候，她只看得清自己的手。\n那就夠了。",
  "afterword_en": "She ground the maize nine times, until it was fine as smoke.\nOne day she saw very far. Then the window clouded with breath.\n\nWhen the green shoot came, she could see only her own hands.\nIt was enough.",
  "series_statement": "《神話未完成》\n史旺姬走進流傳至今的神話，留下它最核心的問題，讓它面對今天的生活。神話一直被講述、被使用，所以還沒有完成。",
  "series_statement_en": "Myths in the Making\nSwanky Ji steps into myths that are still being told, keeps the question at their heart, and lets it meet the life we live now. A myth that is still told and still used is not yet finished.",
